{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40104","label":"ENTER HEAVEN"},"label":"The Bullet Fired: B","stage":null,"prev":"event_enterheaven_05_s","next":"event_enterheaven_06_s","speakers":{"eh_n":"E.H.","elysionharper":"Elysion Harper","enterheavenman":"Male Heavenly Ascension Member"},"icons":{"eh_n":"si_c113_00_s","elysionharper":"si_c940_00_s","enterheavenman":"si_c911_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_1","text":"Just as Crow predicted, after the AFX Incident,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"RuinTechIndoor","bgArt":"ruintechindoor","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_chapter37_field_swarmnest","movie":null,"shown":["eh_n"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_2","text":"the name Heavenly Ascension spread across the entire Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_3","text":"The things we'd shouted, which no one ever listened to, finally spread everywhere.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_4","text":"Ark citizens begin to recognize that people live in the Outer Rim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_5","text":"As soon as public opinion started to deem the Central Government's initial response as inadequate,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_6","text":"the government got in touch with us, saying they wanted to enter into negotiations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_7","text":"What kind of negotiations?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_8","text":"They said they would listen to everything we had to say.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_9","text":"Of course, given how much death and destruction the attack had caused, we were on high alert,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_10","text":"but the government assured us they were aware that only a small number of us were behind it,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_11","text":"and that we could bring as many armed guards as we wanted if we were uneasy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_12","text":"Even still, I hesitated. The one who ultimately convinced me was...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_13","text":"my mother.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_14","text":"\"I'll hear you out. Come if you want to clean up this mess.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_15","text":"That was the message I got from her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_16","text":"So we decided to arm ourselves and head over.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_05_e_17","text":"We figured that the attack had already happened, and sitting around wasn't going to change anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_05_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key